Copyright (c) 2011-2024 Thesys Inc.). The following parts are ports or copies
of that work and keep its license:

- lib/openui/lang/lexer.rb, expressions.rb, statements.rb, parser.rb,
  stream_parser.rb, materialize.rb, validation.rb, builtins.rb, message.rb,
  merge.rb, form_validation.rb: ports of packages/lang-core/src (parser,
  runtime, message, merge, validation) to Ruby.
- lib/openui/library/prompt.rb: a port of packages/lang-core/src/parser/prompt.ts,
  including its prompt text.
- test/fixtures/openui/1.0: a copy of spec/fixtures/1.0 (conformance cases).
